[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [ ] [38;5;153mOverdue tasks[39m
  [38;5;246mDue date has passed and the task isn't complete. The clearest signal, and the one that needs no configuration.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Due soon
  [38;5;246mTask comes due within some window (today, next hour). Needs a rule for the window — global default or per-task.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Stale tasks
  [38;5;246mCreated or last touched N days ago with no progress. Catches things that quietly rot; no due date required.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Explicit reminder time
  [38;5;246mYou set 'remind me at X' per task, independent of the due date. Most control, most UI, most state to manage.[39m
